ole army m.:\nप्रयातु वाहिनी सर्वा, A. r.;\n(2) व्रजति, अभि-, (व्रज्, c. l.);\nshould m.\nagainst an enemy, drawing up the forces in\nbattle-array:\nबलं व्यूह्य द्विषतोऽभिमुखं व्रजेत्, Ka.\nxviii. 2.;\n(3) चलति, सं-, उत् (चल्, c. 1.)\n(= to move),\nthe great army m. ed:\nमहाचमूश्च-\nचाल, Ki.;\n(4) प्रतिष्ठते (स्था, c. l (= to start),\nm. ed by land:\nप्रतस्थे स्थलवर्त्मना, R. iv. 60.", "gloss_language": "sa"}, {"gloss": "MARCH (v.t.):\n(1) नयति (नी, c. l (= to\nlead: q. v.);\n(2) expr. by intrans.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "marches": [{"id": "marches", "headword": "marches", "headword_slp1": "marches", "fold": "marches", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARCHES: प्रान्ताः (m. pl.): v. Boundary.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "marching": [{"id": "marching", "headword": "marching", "headword_slp1": "marching", "fold": "marching", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARCHING (subs.):\n(1) प्रयाणम्;\n(2) प्रस्थानम्:\nv. March (II).", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "marchiones": [{"id": "marchioness", "headword": "marchioness", "headword_slp1": "marchioness", "fold": "marchiones", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARCHIONESS: *नायिका; मार्क्षी।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "mare": [{"id": "mare", "headword": "mare", "headword_slp1": "mare", "fold": "mare", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARE:\n(1) वामी;\n(2) वडवा;\n(3) घोटकी;\n(4)\nअश्वा;\n(5) हयी।", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "margin": [{"id": "margin", "headword": "margin", "headword_slp1": "margin", "fold": "margin", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARGIN: धारः: v. Also edge, border.", "gloss_language": "sa"}]}], "marginal": [{"id": "marginal", "headword": "marginal", "headword_slp1": "marginal", "fold": "marginal", "headword_language": "en", "source": "borooah", "senses": [{"gloss": "MARGINAL: धारे लिखितः\nor\nधारलिखितः (ता, तं) (?).